utilize the results?", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To examine how women use the nuchal translucency (NT) risk adjustment in  
decision-making for invasive prenatal diagnosis. STUDY DESIGN Retrospective cohort study of 1083 consecutive NT         
screening exams. A screen-positive test was defined as a risk > or = 1/300. Primary outcome was what proportion of      
