  100], "studies": [{"study_index": 1, "title": "Ultrasound screening for chromosomal anomalies in the first trimester  
  of pregnancy", "abstract": "For the last 6 years, sonographic signs for excessive fluid accumulation in the backs of  
  10- to 12-week-old fetuses have been looked for prior to transabdominal chorionic biopsy. In 1400 pregnancies,        
