│ beta-protein will be useful in the prenatal detection of trisomy 21."}, {"study_index": 586, "title": "Age‐specific  │
│ variation in aneuploidy incidence among biochemical screening programs", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE Our purpose was to   │
│ compare the observed age-related incidence of Down syndrome in two large screening programs with the commonly quoted │
