│ thickness with second‐trimester biochemistry to screen for trisomy 21", "abstract": "Objective To assess             │
│ second‐trimester screening for trisomy 21 by combining ultrasound nuchal fold (NF) measurement with maternal serum   │
│ biochemistry.   Methods NF, maternal serum α‐fetoprotein (AFP) and free β‐human chorionic gonadotropin (β‐hCG) were  │
