│ "title": "Enhanced twin pregnancy detection within an open neural tube defect and Down syndrome screening protocol   │
│ using free‐ß hCG and AFP", "abstract": "We have applied our multimarker approach of maternal serum alpha-fetoprotein │
│ (AFP) and free-beta human chorionic gonadotropin (hCG) for Down syndrome screening to multiple gestations to assess  │
