  1.11 plus minus 0.05 respectively. No significant differences could be observed between pregnancies following         
  stimulated IVF/ICSI and unstimulated FET cycles. CONCLUSIONS Our results show that second trimester maternal serum    
  HCG is also elevated in singleton pregnancies following spontaneous FET cycles. The increased maternal serum HCG in   
