│ Review title: First trimester serum tests for Down's syndrome screening                                              │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ Selection criteria:                                                                                                  │
│ - Include studies where all women from a given population had one or more index test(s) compared to a reference      │
│ standard (chromosomal verification or macroscopic postnatal inspection)                                              │
│ - Both consecutive series and diagnostic case-control study designs are included                                     │
│ - Randomised trials where individuals were randomised to different screening strategies and all verified using a     │
│ reference standard are eligible                                                                                      │
│ - Studies comparing test strategies head-to-head in the same women or between randomised groups are eligible         │
│ - Exclude studies with less than five Down's syndrome cases                                                          │
│ - Exclude studies where more than 20% of participants were not followed up                                           │
