  amniocentesis, screen positive rate, odds of being affected given a positive result, miscarriages associated with     
  amniocentesis offered following a high risk result, detection rate, number of Down's cases prevented and a cost       
  analysis. Outcome measures were compared between Asians and Caucasians. RESULTS Overall 11,974 women (71%) accepted   
