│ findings. CONCLUSION Midtrimester ultrasonographic targeted fetal organ screening plays a critical role in prenatal  │
│ diagnosis of trisomy 21 among women under the age of 35 years."}, {"study_index": 597, "title": "Enhanced twin       │
